n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"11486\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>As we saw previously,</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"28.418ex\" height=\"5.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -2.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1508.9 12235.6 2515.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n\\textrm E[X] = \\int_0^\\infty \\lambda xe^{-\\lambda x}\\textrm d x = \\dfrac1\\lambda,\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-45\" d=\"M128 619Q121 626 117 628T101 631T58 634H25V680H597V676Q599 670 611 560T625 444V440H585V444Q584 447 582 465Q578 500 570 526T553 571T528 601T498 619T457 629T411 633T353 634Q266 634 251 633T233 622Q233 622 233 621Q232 619 232 497V376H286Q359 378 377 385Q413 401 416 469Q416 471 416 473V493H456V213H416V233Q415 268 408 288T383 317T349 328T297 330Q290 330 286 330H232V196V114Q232 57 237 52Q243 47 289 47H340H391Q428 47 452 50T505 62T552 92T584 146Q594 172 599 200T607 247T612 270V273H652V270Q651 267 632 137T610 3V0H25V46H58Q100 47 109 49T128 61V619Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-5B\" d=\"M118 -250V750H255V710H158V-210H255V-250H118Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMATHI-58\" d=\"M42 0H40Q26 0 26 11Q26 15 29 27Q33 41 36 43T55 46Q141 49 190 98Q200 108 306 224T411 342Q302 620 297 625Q288 636 234 637H206Q200 643 200 645T202 664Q206 677 212 683H226Q260 681 347 681Q380 681 408 681T453 682T473 682Q490 682 490 671Q490 670 488 658Q484 643 481 640T465 637Q434 634 411 620L488 426L541 485Q646 598 646 610Q646 628 622 635Q617 635 609 637Q594 637 594 648Q594 650 596 664Q600 677 606 683H618Q619 683 643 683T697 681T738 680Q828 680 837 683H845Q852 676 852 672Q850 647 840 637H824Q790 636 763 628T722 611T698 593L687 584Q687 585 592 480L505 384Q505 383 536 304T601 142T638 56Q648 47 699 46Q734 46 734 37Q734 35 732 23Q728 7 725 4T